%% State Diagram - Trạng thái đơn hàng
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WAITING_PAYMENT : VNPay
    [*] --> PENDING : COD

    WAITING_PAYMENT --> PENDING : Thanh toán thành công
    WAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : Hết hạn / Khách hủy

    PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Admin xác nhận
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : Khách / Admin hủy

    CONFIRMED --> PREPARING
    PREPARING --> SHIPPING
    SHIPPING --> DELIVERED
    DELIVERED --> COMPLETED

    DELIVERED --> RETURN_REQUESTED : Khách yêu cầu hoàn trả
    COMPLETED --> RETURN_REQUESTED

    RETURN_REQUESTED --> RETURN_APPROVED : Admin duyệt
    RETURN_REQUESTED --> COMPLETED : Admin từ chối
    RETURN_APPROVED --> REFUNDED : Đã hoàn tiền

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
